    "name": "Horizon Valley",
    "steam_appid": 2835040,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835040/extras/7380b631c2071c372565cafccbb4d336.avif?t=1752791413\" width=600 height=188 /></span><br><br>Embark on an endless adventure in our dynamic endless runner game where every run is a unique experience! Navigate through a constantly changing landscape filled with thrilling obstacles that will put your reflexes to the test. But that's not all - immerse yourself in a world of customization with our diverse range of menus. Personalize your character with an array of stunning outfits, unlock epic treasures from mysterious chests, and watch as your avatar transforms into a true legend before your eyes. With each run, discover new challenges and breathtaking vistas, ensuring every moment is filled with excitement and anticipation. Get ready to run, customize, and conquer like never before in our captivating endless runner experience!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835040/extras/7380b631c2071c372565cafccbb4d336.avif?t=1752791413\" width=600 height=188 /></span><br><br>Embark on an endless adventure in our dynamic endless runner game where every run is a unique experience! Navigate through a constantly changing landscape filled with thrilling obstacles that will put your reflexes to the test. But that's not all - immerse yourself in a world of customization with our diverse range of menus. Personalize your character with an array of stunning outfits, unlock epic treasures from mysterious chests, and watch as your avatar transforms into a true legend before your eyes. With each run, discover new challenges and breathtaking vistas, ensuring every moment is filled with excitement and anticipation. Get ready to run, customize, and conquer like never before in our captivating endless runner experience!",
    "short_description": "Horizon Valley is an exciting endless runner where you'll encounter different types of scenarios. Your goal is not only to set a new record with every attempt but also to unlock incredible characters and ships that suit your style. You can obtain them through random chests, special spins, and more!",
